<figure class="garment-check-map">
  <div class="garment-check-drawing">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 340 390" role="img" aria-labelledby="garment-check-title garment-check-desc">
      <title id="garment-check-title">Four checks for a garment slider bag sample</title>
      <desc id="garment-check-desc">A schematic inner bag containing a folded garment. The numbered points identify usable space below the zipper, slider travel and closure, finish and artwork visibility, and the closed inner pack to measure for a separate outer mailer.</desc>
      <rect x="62" y="61" width="215" height="258" rx="9" fill="#f1f3ec" stroke="#203c30" stroke-width="2" />
      <path d="M74 86H265M74 94H265M78 116V302H261V116" fill="none" stroke="#536157" stroke-dasharray="5 4" />
      <rect x="214" y="78" width="28" height="24" rx="5" fill="#fff" stroke="#203c30" stroke-width="2" />
      <path d="m116 146 31-14h45l31 14 18 37-25 13-11-20v88H134v-88l-11 20-25-13z" fill="#d5ddcc" stroke="#536157" stroke-width="1.5" />
      <rect x="143" y="207" width="54" height="26" rx="3" fill="#fff" stroke="#536157" />
      <text x="170" y="224" text-anchor="middle" class="label">SKU</text>
      <path d="M82 284H256M82 278v12M256 278v12" fill="none" stroke="#536157" />
      <g fill="#b63b10"><circle cx="65" cy="160" r="17"/><circle cx="264" cy="89" r="17"/><circle cx="247" cy="226" r="17"/><circle cx="170" cy="319" r="17"/></g>
      <g class="check-number" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central"><text x="65" y="160">1</text><text x="264" y="89">2</text><text x="247" y="226">3</text><text x="170" y="319">4</text></g>
      <text x="170" y="35" text-anchor="middle">Check the actual folded item</text>
      <text x="170" y="364" text-anchor="middle">Inner bag → separate outer pack</text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption><strong>Review one bag version with its real garment</strong><ol><li><b>Usable space:</b> measure between seams and below the zipper; include the fold, tags and inserts.</li><li><b>Slider and closure:</b> check loading, opening and full reclosure using the agreed method.</li><li><b>Finish and identification:</b> compare the physical finish, logo and intended label with the garment inside.</li><li><b>Complete packing combination:</b> measure the closed inner pack again and trial the selected outer mailer.</li></ol></figcaption>
</figure>
<p class="garment-map-note">Illustration only, not a measured product or test result. Confirm the offered material, usable dimensions, check method and acceptance criteria for your selected sample. The garment bag is inner packaging.</p>
<style>
  .garment-check-map{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,.85fr) minmax(0,1.15fr);gap:24px;align-items:center;margin:26px 0 12px;padding:24px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;background:var(--white)}.garment-check-drawing{min-width:0}.garment-check-map svg{display:block;width:100%;max-width:340px;height:auto;margin-inline:auto}.garment-check-map svg text{font:16px Inter,Arial,sans-serif;fill:var(--ink)}.garment-check-map svg .label{font-size:13px}.garment-check-map .check-number text{fill:white;font-weight:750}.garment-check-map figcaption{min-width:0;font-size:.95rem;line-height:1.65}.garment-check-map figcaption>strong{display:block;color:var(--ink);font-size:1.05rem;line-height:1.4}.garment-check-map ol{padding-left:22px;margin:18px 0 0}.garment-check-map li{margin-bottom:12px}.garment-map-note{font-size:.875rem!important;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.65}@media(max-width:760px){.garment-check-map{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr);padding:18px;gap:12px}.garment-check-map svg{max-width:300px}}
